Hi @johan_bendz,

Your rabbit hole on TUYA devices expended rapidly! 

Nice work though!

I’ve expanded my zigbee network to 70 devices and TUYA really likes TRADFRI power sockets to mesh with. Some weeks ago I had to factory reset homey because the zigbee manager completely failed after the last homey update to 5 RC50. The best thing is that all devices connect fast and without problems on every spot in and around the house after starting with connecting routers devices first. Every one of them could be added with the switches so non of them had to be accessed in their build in location behind switches or ceilings. hopefully this will help others in the community.

I also received a new version of the curtain module and looking forward to replace the roller shutters since they are the few remaining z-wave devices I stil have. Hopefully You get them to work aswell.

