Hi Johan,

I have a Blitswolf SHP13, (TS0121), smart plug with energy reading, which is supported and indeed works.

The only setback is that the power lags a lot behind after switching on a load. E.g. it takes about a minute before the change in watt is visible in homey, after switching on a load via de plug. I tried to update the firmware of the plug but it is at the latest version. To do so I ordered at aliexpress the zigbee gateway hub here

When using this hub, I noticed that in the app for the hub, power changes are displayed within 5 seconds, so I thought, would this also be possible for the homey tuya app ?

